          (text "Auxiliary supply, contactors, thermal chain and fan" (at 209.55 15.24 0)
          (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify top))
          (uuid "a0f66c90-c28b-58c0-9dc0-5916b6160806"))
(text "TS1, TS2 and SSTOP symbols represent contacts closed in the healthy/cold condition; open-on-rise or actuated opens the chain. Actual thermostat contact load: 3.3 V /3.3\nmA. Dry-contact reliability and temperature lag require qualification. F2: KLKD008.T in separate L60030M1C + SPL001. Inrush, derating and source/fuse coordination still\nrequire qualification. K1/K2 each require up to3.8 A for130 ms. Keep their pickup-current returns out of the electronics input harness. M1 PWM open behavior and lead\ncolors require exact-revision supplier confirmation before wiring." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
          (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
          (uuid "d387cbb3-05f1-5b90-be74-28edc48410f2"))
(text "Independent isolated 12 V / 10 A source, separate branch returns" (at 20.32 50.8 0)
          (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
          (uuid "1a2b4b95-3074-5b66-b557-93fc202de8be"))
(text "Contactor coils and auxiliary contacts" (at 180.34 105.41 0)
          (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
          (uuid "a66b5f59-e71c-5e0a-adda-b60894a41f4e"))
(text "Fail-open chain; not a certified emergency-stop safety function" (at 20.32 160.02 0)
          (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
          (uuid "9e38fef9-fa33-5678-a5db-435873357378"))
(text "12 V fan tach supervised by firmware; PWM lead insulated open" (at 20.32 219.71 0)
          (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
          (uuid "05f3bafe-30fc-577f-b9de-92fd90b11b24"))
